            <ArticleTitle>A double-blind crossover comparison of topical anesthetics.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>213-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three topical anesthetics and a placebo were compared in 102 separate trials. The degree of anesthesia produced with each agent was determined by placing a needle in the palate near the palatal foramen. Pain produced was rated by the participants on a scale from 1 to 5.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
